<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14127" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπότροπ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτρέπω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turned away, far from men,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγὼ παρ᾽ ὕεσσιν ἀπότροπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.372
				</span></i>
			; <i>turned away in flight,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				4.254
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>from which one turns away, horrible,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἄγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					155
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἀ. Ἅιδαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					608
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκότου νέφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OT</u>
					1314
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					792
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνώμη ἀ.</span> a <i>stern,
				hostile</i> decree, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				8.94
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κασιγνήτης ἀπότροπον . . εὐνήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ps.-Phoc.
					182
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>turning away, averting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					42
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				586
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. δαίμονες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					203
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>preventing, saving from,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. αὐτοῖς ἐγέετο μή . .,</span> c.
				inf., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				877a
			</span></i>.</div>
